{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">夏天天氣悶熱，想飲啖清甜又消暑的湯水？在節目《今個夏天食平D》中，肥媽就親自示範了一款極之簡單易做的「竹蔗茅根馬蹄蘋果湯」。此湯水具有清熱解毒的功效，絕對是夏天消暑解渴的必飲之選！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b04d2199-2d8d-42d6-9d4c-e270c033b682.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026zwwW9M1j9j1785835623.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b04d2199-2d8d-42d6-9d4c-e270c033b682.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\">所需食材</h4><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">竹蔗</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">茅根</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">馬蹄</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">瘦肉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蘋果</p></li></ul><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\">烹調步驟</h4><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"17baea8d-3e1f-4f33-b1b4-65e4dc47e4e3.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026UhWI3HSPjy1785835627.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"17baea8d-3e1f-4f33-b1b4-65e4dc47e4e3.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T09:04:42.347162+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}